sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant A as apply-release.sh
  participant C as Cli (reload)
  participant R as RunControl
  participant S as Shrinker (old release)
  participant X as SelfRestart
  participant N as Shrinker (new release, same PID)
  U->>A: mediatools update
  A->>A: patch, PR, CI, tag, install.sh
  A->>C: mediatools reload
  C->>R: request_restart() - state/shrink.restart
  Note over S: current file: encode, validate, replace, record
  S->>R: restart requested? (between two files)
  S->>X: installed_version() (python -m mediatools --version)
  alt fails or same version
    S->>R: clear_restart() - run continues
  else new version
    S->>S: close result table, summary
    S->>R: handover() (PID + status files stay)
    S->>X: execute() - os.execv
    X->>N: python -m mediatools shrink ... --foreground -y --continue-log LOG
    N->>R: start() (own PID: allowed)
    N->>N: plan again (databases, caches)
    N->>N: continue with the files left
  end
